
## Main
    Let mutable going be true.
    While going:
        Read line from the console.
        If line equals "end":
            Set going to false.
        Otherwise:
            Let f be split(line, ",").
            Let s be a new Situation with minute parseInt(item 1 of f) and site parseInt(item 2 of f) and price parseInt(item 3 of f) and carbon parseInt(item 4 of f) and event parseInt(item 5 of f) and target parseInt(item 6 of f) and urgent parseInt(item 7 of f) and batch parseInt(item 8 of f) and backlog parseInt(item 9 of f) and left parseInt(item 10 of f) and room parseInt(item 11 of f) and otherPrice parseInt(item 12 of f) and otherInEvent parseInt(item 13 of f) and ownRoom parseInt(item 14 of f).
            Let p be pauseFor(s).
            Let m be moveFor(s).
            Let b be boostFor(s).
            Show "{p},{m},{b}".
